    {
      "name": "moe-int4-per-bucket-tiling-and-byte-once-dequant",
      "description": "Per-bucket BLOCK_M/num_warps/nonkdim plus byte-once dual-nibble int4 dequant stacks to ~4.6x on int4-weight MoE grouped GEMM, gfx950",
      "keywords": [
        "moe",
